            ("Is flood damage from the Muskingum River covered by my Zanesville homeowners policy?", "No. Homeowners policies exclude flood. Coverage for river flooding requires a separate flood policy through the NFIP or a private insurer. Wind or tree damage from the same storm may still be covered under your homeowners policy."),
            ("A tree fell on my Muskingum County garage. What should the estimate include?", "Beyond the visible roof damage, the estimate should consider framing, sheathing, gutters, doors, contents inside and tree removal. Many policies cap tree removal, so check your policy for the limit."),
